"Grandmother and grandson, we two depend on each other for life; that is why, in my small way, I cannot abandon her and go far.": "9707783766b6",
"Her breath faint, her life frail and shallow, so that in the morning one cannot count on the evening.": "fbc1e88ccdc1",
"I beg Your Majesty to pity my foolish sincerity and grant my small wish, so that Liu may by good fortune see out her remaining years.": "aef9a3612413",
"I have no uncles, and in the end no brothers either.": "8ab15a58a21d",
